  "source_title": "于敏\n没留过一天洋，却造出中国氢弹，外国人慌了：不可能，你们肯定是偷的\n#于敏  #中国科学家 #国之脊梁 #中国氢弹之父 #历史名人故事",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_3706898b9468c498_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 420.35,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "没留过一天，羊却造出中国氢弹，外国人慌了，不可能，你们肯定是偷的家人们。全世界造氢弹，美国用了七年多，苏联用了四年，可有一个国家连计算机都没有，只用了两年零八个月就造出来了，比美国快了四年半。外国人打死不信，说中国人肯定是偷的。可他们不知道造出这颗氢弹的药人，这辈子连一天羊都没留过，他叫俞敏。今天我就给你讲讲这个让外国人慌了神的中国老人。俞敏年轻的时候是国内顶尖的理论物理天才，二十多岁，就在学术界闯出了名气。当时很多人都说俞敏要是去国外留学深造，将来肯定能拿诺贝尔奖。可就在一九六一年领导找他谈了一次话，改变了他的一生。领导说，国家要搞氢弹，需要你转行来做这件事是最高机密，以后你就不能再发表论文了也不能再公开露面。你的名字要从学术界彻底消失。那时候的渔民在自己的研究领域正做的顺风顺水，前途一片光明。搞清淡，意味着要放弃自己熟悉的领域，从零开始，还要隐姓埋名，一辈子不能出名，换做别人，可能还要犹豫一下，可俞敏当场就答应了。他说，国家兴亡，匹夫有责，国家需要我，我就去做外国人，能造出来的，我们中国人也一定能就这么着，于敏从公众视野里彻底消失了，这一消失就是整整二十八年。搞清淡有多难。当时全世界只有美国和苏联掌握氢弹技术，严密封锁，连一点点资料都露不出来。我们没有经验，没有图纸，甚至连氢弹长什么样都不知道。没有计算机，他们就用算盘算，用计算尺算几个人，一组轮班倒，一天算十几个小时，眼睛都熬红了手都算肿了。算出来的草稿纸堆满了一整个屋子，俞敏更是拼，他每天工作十几个小时，连吃饭睡觉都在想问题。有好几次，他因为过度劳累，直接晕倒在了办公室，被送到医院抢救醒过来。第一句话还是问工作进展怎么样了。那时候条件苦，吃不饱，穿不暖。冬天办公室里没有暖气，冻得手都握不住笔，可没有一个人叫苦，没有一个人退缩。因为大家心里都清楚，这不是一份普通的工作，这是在给国家铸盾牌，就这么没日没夜的干，俞敏带领团队居然真的摸索出了一套完全属于中国人自己的清淡方案。也就是后来震惊世界的俞敏构型。这个构型有多牛？全世界的清淡一共就两种构型。遗嘱是美国的，另一种就是中国的渔敏构型。而且俞敏构型在维护成本保存时间上比美国的还要先进。一九六七年六月十七日，罗布泊情俞敏站在指挥所外面，仰头看着天空，那架运载氢弹的飞机在头顶画着圈儿，一圈儿又一圈，现场安静的能听见自己的心跳。八点整天空突然亮了，比太阳还亮，一朵巨大的蘑菇云从地平线上升起来越升越高。像一座突然长出来的山，所有人都疯了，跳起来抱在一起，哭的笑的吼的闹的混成一片，只有俞敏站在原地一动不动。他仰着头看着那片蘑菇云看了很久很久，然后眼泪顺着他的脸颊无声的留了下来。他没有欢呼，也没有说话，可家人们你们知道吗？为了这一天，这个文弱书生几年里晕倒在办公室，好多次被送进医院醒过来，第一句话问的还是算到哪一步了？从一张白纸到这颗清淡。他只用了两年零八个月，美国人用了七年多，苏联人用了四年。外国的专家们怎么也想不通，一个连计算机都要靠算盘的国家，怎么可能这么快？他们不懂，他们永远也不会懂中国人逼急了，是可以不要命的氢弹造出来了，可于敏的名字还是没人知道。他继续隐姓埋名，继续在幕后默默工作，为中国的核武器事业操劳。直到一九八八年，俞敏的身份才正式解密。这时候，人们才知道，原来中国氢弹的背后，有这样一位伟大的科学家。有人问他，你这辈子隐姓埋名，放弃了名利，放弃了学术前途，后悔吗？俞敏笑着说，我这辈子最大的心愿就是国家不受欺负，能为国家他做点事儿，我这辈子就值了。家人们，什么叫民族脊梁？这就是啊没有留过洋，没有喝过洋墨水。可他凭着一腔爱国热血，凭着一股子不服输的劲头，硬生生为中国撑起了一把核保护伞。他没有拿过诺贝尔奖，可他的功劳比诺贝尔奖重千斤。他的名字值得我们每一个中国人永远铭记为于老感到自豪的在评论区打中国骄傲四个字，让咱中国人看看有多少人记得他把这条视频转到同学群、战友群，让大家看看中国人到底有多硬气。点个收藏以后，孩子问为什么咱们中国这么牛，这就是现成的答案。关注我，每天讲一位国之脊梁。像俞敏这样为国助盾的人，书里还有四十位，每一篇都让你觉得生在中国值了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1250,
      "text": "没留过一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1250,
      "end_ms": 3470,
      "text": "羊却造出中国氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4270,
      "end_ms": 5370,
      "text": "外国人慌了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6350,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "不可能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7750,
      "end_ms": 10170,
      "text": "你们肯定是偷的家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10310,
      "end_ms": 11790,
      "text": "全世界造氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12150,
      "end_ms": 13650,
      "text": "美国用了七年多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13970,
      "end_ms": 15270,
      "text": "苏联用了四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15850,
      "end_ms": 18450,
      "text": "可有一个国家连计算机都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18690,
      "end_ms": 21390,
      "text": "只用了两年零八个月就造出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21510,
      "end_ms": 23010,
      "text": "比美国快了四年半。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23590,
      "end_ms": 24870,
      "text": "外国人打死不信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25130,
      "end_ms": 26790,
      "text": "说中国人肯定是偷的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27210,
      "end_ms": 30340,
      "text": "可他们不知道造出这颗氢弹的药人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30660,
      "end_ms": 32860,
      "text": "这辈子连一天羊都没留过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33620,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "text": "他叫俞敏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00017",
      "start_ms": 34980,
      "end_ms": 38960,
      "text": "今天我就给你讲讲这个让外国人慌了神的中国老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40080,
      "end_ms": 45020,
      "text": "俞敏年轻的时候是国内顶尖的理论物理天才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00019",
      "start_ms": 45860,
      "end_ms": 46680,
      "text": "二十多岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00020",
      "start_ms": 46860,
      "end_ms": 49440,
      "text": "就在学术界闯出了名气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50120,
      "end_ms": 53860,
      "text": "当时很多人都说俞敏要是去国外留学深造，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00022",
      "start_ms": 54200,
      "end_ms": 56020,
      "text": "将来肯定能拿诺贝尔奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56560,
      "end_ms": 59885,
      "text": "可就在一九六一年领导找他谈了一次话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60230,
      "end_ms": 61395,
      "text": "改变了他的一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00025",
      "start_ms": 61970,
      "end_ms": 62645,
      "text": "领导说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00026",
      "start_ms": 63790,
      "end_ms": 64945,
      "text": "国家要搞氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00027",
      "start_ms": 65800,
      "end_ms": 70360,
      "text": "需要你转行来做这件事是最高机密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00028",
      "start_ms": 70380,
      "end_ms": 75015,
      "text": "以后你就不能再发表论文了也不能再公开露面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75910,
      "end_ms": 79445,
      "text": "你的名字要从学术界彻底消失。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80090,
      "end_ms": 84795,
      "text": "那时候的渔民在自己的研究领域正做的顺风顺水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00031",
      "start_ms": 85470,
      "end_ms": 86895,
      "text": "前途一片光明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00032",
      "start_ms": 87450,
      "end_ms": 88155,
      "text": "搞清淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00033",
      "start_ms": 88450,
      "end_ms": 91005,
      "text": "意味着要放弃自己熟悉的领域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00034",
      "start_ms": 91510,
      "end_ms": 92645,
      "text": "从零开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92960,
      "end_ms": 94445,
      "text": "还要隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00036",
      "start_ms": 94810,
      "end_ms": 96095,
      "text": "一辈子不能出名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96630,
      "end_ms": 97565,
      "text": "换做别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00038",
      "start_ms": 97920,
      "end_ms": 99545,
      "text": "可能还要犹豫一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100140,
      "end_ms": 101925,
      "text": "可俞敏当场就答应了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102750,
      "end_ms": 103135,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00041",
      "start_ms": 103620,
      "end_ms": 104620,
      "text": "国家兴亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00042",
      "start_ms": 104940,
      "end_ms": 106135,
      "text": "匹夫有责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00043",
      "start_ms": 106530,
      "end_ms": 107610,
      "text": "国家需要我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107610,
      "end_ms": 109250,
      "text": "我就去做外国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00045",
      "start_ms": 109250,
      "end_ms": 110215,
      "text": "能造出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00046",
      "start_ms": 110460,
      "end_ms": 113775,
      "text": "我们中国人也一定能就这么着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114120,
      "end_ms": 117175,
      "text": "于敏从公众视野里彻底消失了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00048",
      "start_ms": 117430,
      "end_ms": 120535,
      "text": "这一消失就是整整二十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00049",
      "start_ms": 121140,
      "end_ms": 122425,
      "text": "搞清淡有多难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123280,
      "end_ms": 127105,
      "text": "当时全世界只有美国和苏联掌握氢弹技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127440,
      "end_ms": 128500,
      "text": "严密封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128700,
      "end_ms": 131165,
      "text": "连一点点资料都露不出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131710,
      "end_ms": 132725,
      "text": "我们没有经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132930,
      "end_ms": 133655,
      "text": "没有图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00055",
      "start_ms": 134170,
      "end_ms": 136565,
      "text": "甚至连氢弹长什么样都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00056",
      "start_ms": 137120,
      "end_ms": 138100,
      "text": "没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138380,
      "end_ms": 139795,
      "text": "他们就用算盘算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00058",
      "start_ms": 140120,
      "end_ms": 142060,
      "text": "用计算尺算几个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00059",
      "start_ms": 142060,
      "end_ms": 143485,
      "text": "一组轮班倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00060",
      "start_ms": 143890,
      "end_ms": 145615,
      "text": "一天算十几个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00061",
      "start_ms": 146100,
      "end_ms": 149045,
      "text": "眼睛都熬红了手都算肿了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00062",
      "start_ms": 149530,
      "end_ms": 152995,
      "text": "算出来的草稿纸堆满了一整个屋子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00063",
      "start_ms": 153350,
      "end_ms": 154445,
      "text": "俞敏更是拼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00064",
      "start_ms": 154990,
      "end_ms": 156825,
      "text": "他每天工作十几个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00065",
      "start_ms": 157120,
      "end_ms": 159115,
      "text": "连吃饭睡觉都在想问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00066",
      "start_ms": 159750,
      "end_ms": 160745,
      "text": "有好几次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00067",
      "start_ms": 161050,
      "end_ms": 162490,
      "text": "他因为过度劳累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00068",
      "start_ms": 162670,
      "end_ms": 164915,
      "text": "直接晕倒在了办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00069",
      "start_ms": 165460,
      "end_ms": 168530,
      "text": "被送到医院抢救醒过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00070",
      "start_ms": 168530,
      "end_ms": 171714,
      "text": "第一句话还是问工作进展怎么样了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00071",
      "start_ms": 172440,
      "end_ms": 173520,
      "text": "那时候条件苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00072",
      "start_ms": 173660,
      "end_ms": 174220,
      "text": "吃不饱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00073",
      "start_ms": 174260,
      "end_ms": 174885,
      "text": "穿不暖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00074",
      "start_ms": 175260,
      "end_ms": 177280,
      "text": "冬天办公室里没有暖气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00075",
      "start_ms": 177400,
      "end_ms": 179084,
      "text": "冻得手都握不住笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00076",
      "start_ms": 179810,
      "end_ms": 181470,
      "text": "可没有一个人叫苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00077",
      "start_ms": 181690,
      "end_ms": 183135,
      "text": "没有一个人退缩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00078",
      "start_ms": 183820,
      "end_ms": 185425,
      "text": "因为大家心里都清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00079",
      "start_ms": 186000,
      "end_ms": 187965,
      "text": "这不是一份普通的工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00080",
      "start_ms": 188640,
      "end_ms": 190485,
      "text": "这是在给国家铸盾牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00081",
      "start_ms": 190960,
      "end_ms": 192645,
      "text": "就这么没日没夜的干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00082",
      "start_ms": 193440,
      "end_ms": 201035,
      "text": "俞敏带领团队居然真的摸索出了一套完全属于中国人自己的清淡方案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00083",
      "start_ms": 201240,
      "end_ms": 203735,
      "text": "也就是后来震惊世界的俞敏构型。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00084",
      "start_ms": 204300,
      "end_ms": 205565,
      "text": "这个构型有多牛？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00085",
      "start_ms": 205990,
      "end_ms": 209505,
      "text": "全世界的清淡一共就两种构型。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00086",
      "start_ms": 210070,
      "end_ms": 211375,
      "text": "遗嘱是美国的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00087",
      "start_ms": 211770,
      "end_ms": 213985,
      "text": "另一种就是中国的渔敏构型。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00088",
      "start_ms": 214850,
      "end_ms": 221035,
      "text": "而且俞敏构型在维护成本保存时间上比美国的还要先进。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00089",
      "start_ms": 222190,
      "end_ms": 224055,
      "text": "一九六七年六月十七日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00090",
      "start_ms": 224400,
      "end_ms": 228165,
      "text": "罗布泊情俞敏站在指挥所外面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00091",
      "start_ms": 228560,
      "end_ms": 230375,
      "text": "仰头看着天空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00092",
      "start_ms": 231030,
      "end_ms": 234725,
      "text": "那架运载氢弹的飞机在头顶画着圈儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00093",
      "start_ms": 235170,
      "end_ms": 236635,
      "text": "一圈儿又一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00094",
      "start_ms": 237470,
      "end_ms": 240165,
      "text": "现场安静的能听见自己的心跳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00095",
      "start_ms": 240780,
      "end_ms": 242830,
      "text": "八点整天空突然亮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00096",
      "start_ms": 242830,
      "end_ms": 243735,
      "text": "比太阳还亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00097",
      "start_ms": 244670,
      "end_ms": 249645,
      "text": "一朵巨大的蘑菇云从地平线上升起来越升越高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00098",
      "start_ms": 249940,
      "end_ms": 251985,
      "text": "像一座突然长出来的山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00099",
      "start_ms": 252550,
      "end_ms": 253795,
      "text": "所有人都疯了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00100",
      "start_ms": 254220,
      "end_ms": 255915,
      "text": "跳起来抱在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00101",
      "start_ms": 256360,
      "end_ms": 259495,
      "text": "哭的笑的吼的闹的混成一片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00102",
      "start_ms": 260120,
      "end_ms": 263365,
      "text": "只有俞敏站在原地一动不动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00103",
      "start_ms": 264370,
      "end_ms": 269135,
      "text": "他仰着头看着那片蘑菇云看了很久很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00104",
      "start_ms": 270060,
      "end_ms": 274205,
      "text": "然后眼泪顺着他的脸颊无声的留了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00105",
      "start_ms": 275160,
      "end_ms": 276285,
      "text": "他没有欢呼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00106",
      "start_ms": 276600,
      "end_ms": 277645,
      "text": "也没有说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00107",
      "start_ms": 278160,
      "end_ms": 279815,
      "text": "可家人们你们知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00108",
      "start_ms": 280600,
      "end_ms": 281495,
      "text": "为了这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00109",
      "start_ms": 281990,
      "end_ms": 285510,
      "text": "这个文弱书生几年里晕倒在办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00110",
      "start_ms": 285510,
      "end_ms": 288460,
      "text": "好多次被送进医院醒过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00111",
      "start_ms": 288460,
      "end_ms": 291425,
      "text": "第一句话问的还是算到哪一步了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00112",
      "start_ms": 292030,
      "end_ms": 294725,
      "text": "从一张白纸到这颗清淡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00113",
      "start_ms": 295230,
      "end_ms": 298050,
      "text": "他只用了两年零八个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00114",
      "start_ms": 298670,
      "end_ms": 300330,
      "text": "美国人用了七年多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00115",
      "start_ms": 300830,
      "end_ms": 302250,
      "text": "苏联人用了四年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00116",
      "start_ms": 302830,
      "end_ms": 305110,
      "text": "外国的专家们怎么也想不通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00117",
      "start_ms": 305430,
      "end_ms": 308290,
      "text": "一个连计算机都要靠算盘的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308470,
      "end_ms": 309610,
      "text": "怎么可能这么快？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00119",
      "start_ms": 310150,
      "end_ms": 310910,
      "text": "他们不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00120",
      "start_ms": 311250,
      "end_ms": 314090,
      "text": "他们永远也不会懂中国人逼急了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00121",
      "start_ms": 314570,
      "end_ms": 317790,
      "text": "是可以不要命的氢弹造出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00122",
      "start_ms": 317910,
      "end_ms": 320910,
      "text": "可于敏的名字还是没人知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00123",
      "start_ms": 321210,
      "end_ms": 323130,
      "text": "他继续隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00124",
      "start_ms": 323630,
      "end_ms": 326100,
      "text": "继续在幕后默默工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00125",
      "start_ms": 326400,
      "end_ms": 328780,
      "text": "为中国的核武器事业操劳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00126",
      "start_ms": 329040,
      "end_ms": 330400,
      "text": "直到一九八八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00127",
      "start_ms": 330720,
      "end_ms": 333260,
      "text": "俞敏的身份才正式解密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00128",
      "start_ms": 333860,
      "end_ms": 334420,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00129",
      "start_ms": 334420,
      "end_ms": 335300,
      "text": "人们才知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00130",
      "start_ms": 335660,
      "end_ms": 337640,
      "text": "原来中国氢弹的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00131",
      "start_ms": 337860,
      "end_ms": 340320,
      "text": "有这样一位伟大的科学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00132",
      "start_ms": 340920,
      "end_ms": 341820,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00133",
      "start_ms": 342240,
      "end_ms": 344400,
      "text": "你这辈子隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00134",
      "start_ms": 344700,
      "end_ms": 345720,
      "text": "放弃了名利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00135",
      "start_ms": 346040,
      "end_ms": 347520,
      "text": "放弃了学术前途，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00136",
      "start_ms": 348020,
      "end_ms": 348760,
      "text": "后悔吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00137",
      "start_ms": 349180,
      "end_ms": 350140,
      "text": "俞敏笑着说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00138",
      "start_ms": 350520,
      "end_ms": 354040,
      "text": "我这辈子最大的心愿就是国家不受欺负，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00139",
      "start_ms": 354340,
      "end_ms": 355730,
      "text": "能为国家他做点事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00140",
      "start_ms": 355730,
      "end_ms": 357135,
      "text": "我这辈子就值了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00141",
      "start_ms": 357670,
      "end_ms": 358310,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00142",
      "start_ms": 358390,
      "end_ms": 359835,
      "text": "什么叫民族脊梁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00143",
      "start_ms": 360270,
      "end_ms": 362165,
      "text": "这就是啊没有留过洋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00144",
      "start_ms": 362510,
      "end_ms": 363785,
      "text": "没有喝过洋墨水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00145",
      "start_ms": 364200,
      "end_ms": 366345,
      "text": "可他凭着一腔爱国热血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00146",
      "start_ms": 366730,
      "end_ms": 369025,
      "text": "凭着一股子不服输的劲头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00147",
      "start_ms": 369610,
      "end_ms": 373125,
      "text": "硬生生为中国撑起了一把核保护伞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00148",
      "start_ms": 373610,
      "end_ms": 375005,
      "text": "他没有拿过诺贝尔奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00149",
      "start_ms": 375390,
      "end_ms": 378485,
      "text": "可他的功劳比诺贝尔奖重千斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00150",
      "start_ms": 379130,
      "end_ms": 389680,
      "text": "他的名字值得我们每一个中国人永远铭记为于老感到自豪的在评论区打中国骄傲四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00151",
      "start_ms": 389740,
      "end_ms": 396455,
      "text": "让咱中国人看看有多少人记得他把这条视频转到同学群、战友群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00152",
      "start_ms": 396960,
      "end_ms": 400085,
      "text": "让大家看看中国人到底有多硬气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00153",
      "start_ms": 400370,
      "end_ms": 402390,
      "text": "点个收藏以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00154",
      "start_ms": 402390,
      "end_ms": 404525,
      "text": "孩子问为什么咱们中国这么牛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00155",
      "start_ms": 405100,
      "end_ms": 406715,
      "text": "这就是现成的答案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00156",
      "start_ms": 407450,
      "end_ms": 408135,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00157",
      "start_ms": 408520,
      "end_ms": 411115,
      "text": "每天讲一位国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00158",
      "start_ms": 411790,
      "end_ms": 414215,
      "text": "像俞敏这样为国助盾的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00159",
      "start_ms": 414620,
      "end_ms": 415845,
      "text": "书里还有四十位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3706898b9468c498_s00160",
      "start_ms": 416370,
      "end_ms": 420245,
      "text": "每一篇都让你觉得生在中国值了。"
    }
  ],
